# SOC 2 evidence packs: dated operational snapshots, produced by
# scripts/collect-soc2-evidence.sh into ./evidence/ at the repo root. They
# contain live configuration and row counts and belong in access-controlled
# storage, not in the repository -- but the collector is checked in so the
# process is reviewable. Anchored to the root so it doesn't also swallow
# docs/evidence/, which holds curated, written-up proof (smoke test runs,
# etc.) that belongs in the repo.
/evidence/
